"description": "Altarea SCA engages in the real estate development industry. It operates through the following segments: Retail, Residential, Business Property, New Businesse and Others. The Retail segment includes shopping centres under management or under development. The Residential segment offers residential property development. The Business Property offers property development, services and investment business. The New Businesse segment is involved in real estate asset management. The company was founded by Alain Taravella and Jacques Nicolet in 1994 and is headquartered in Paris, France.",
